<title>PORTUGAL: Escudo closes down against mark.</title>
<headline>Escudo closes down against mark.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The escudo closed down against the mark, against the background of a late softening in the dollar.</p>
<p>Traders said the market's eyes will be fixed on the meeting of European Union finance ministers, starting Sunday, for any sign of weakening in the group's determination to press ahead with the single currency in January 1999.</p>
<p>The escudo closed at 101.13/18 to the mark against its opening 101.00/03.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
